# Appointment - Hack The Box (Starting Point)

##  Objective

The objective of this machine was to gain access to a web application by identifying and exploiting a SQL Injection vulnerability.

---

# Enumeration

I started by visiting the target web application in the browser.

The application presented a login page.



---

##  Testing the Login Form

Since the application only provided a username and password form, I tested for common authentication bypass vulnerabilities.

I identified that the login form was vulnerable to SQL Injection.

---

## Authentication Bypass

Using a SQL Injection payload, I was able to bypass the login mechanism and gain access to the application.

> Payload omitted for learning purposes.

![Successful Login](got-access.png)

---

##  Flag Retrieval

After gaining access to the application, I navigated through the available pages and successfully retrieved the flag.

![Flag](root-flag.png)

